Cell["\<\
The number of events of the radar domain beside the number of coordinate \
cells, the fibers of the observer space. On the lattices the chart is \
injective; on the sprinkling the observer identifies events.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"da0a7ae0-7868-4661-a09d-d195dcab434c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Table", "[", "\n", "  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "    ", 
